# Keep the build context small and, critically, keep a developer's LOCAL runtime
# database out of the image. `data/` is gitignored, but a stray local copy on
# disk must never be baked into a production layer — that would ship one
# developer's accounts to production and shadow the real volume.
data/
node_modules
.next
.git
.gitignore
*.md
.env
.env.*
.glass-shots
.storage-sandbox
*.tsbuildinfo
